# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI KEYS GO HERE (server side only). They are never put in the app.
# Copy this file to "supabase/.env", paste your key(s), then run:
#   npx supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/.env
# The file supabase/.env is git-ignored and never ships in the app.
#
# You only NEED the Gemini key. ChatGPT and Claude are optional:
# the app shows each one as "Connected" only when its key is set here.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Required. Get it at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=PASTE-YOUR-GEMINI-API-KEY-HERE
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash

# Optional: ChatGPT (OpenAI). Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Leave the line out (or empty) to keep ChatGPT turned off.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.5

# Optional: Claude (Anthropic). Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
# Leave the line out (or empty) to keep Claude turned off.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional cost controls. The defaults are already safe; change only if you need to.
# After editing run again: npx supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/.env
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Longest visible answer, in tokens (256 to 16000). Default 4096.
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=4096
# How hard Gemini 3.x thinks: low (default, cheapest), medium or high. "Deep Think" mode always uses high.
# GEMINI_THINKING_LEVEL=low
# Per-user limits. kind = CHAT, SEARCH, AUX (titles, memory, ideas), TRANSCRIBE
# Defaults: CHAT 12/min 150/day, SEARCH 6/min 40/day, AUX 30/min 400/day, TRANSCRIBE 10/min 100/day
# LIMIT_CHAT_PER_MINUTE=12
# LIMIT_CHAT_PER_DAY=150
# LIMIT_SEARCH_PER_DAY=40
# LIMIT_TRANSCRIBE_PER_DAY=100
